[2026-05-31T16:00:11.260543] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Review - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Review Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'utils.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 32, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 32, 'total_lines': 32, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\nUtility functions for the PSO algorithm.\r\r\n"""\r\r\ndef objective_function(x):\r\r\n    """\r\r\n    Sample objective function: f(x) = x^2\r\r\n    This function is to be minimized.\r\r\n    """\r\r\n"""\r\r\n\r\r\ndef objective_function(x):\r\r\n    """\r\r\n    Sample objective function: f(x) = x^2\r\r\n    This function is to be minimized.\r\r\n    """\r\r\n    return sum([xi ** 2 for xi in x])\r\r\n', 'truncated': False, 'file_size': 373, 'modified_ts': 1780235941.2382276, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 684, 'arguments': {'path': 'utils.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.00371551513671875
