[2026-05-31T16:02:46.532860] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'main.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 17, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 17, 'total_lines': 17, 'snippet': '"""\nThis is the main module to launch the program.\n"""\n\nfrom pso import PSO\nfrom utils import objective_function\n\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    bounds = [-10, 10]\n    num_particles = 30\n    iterations = 100\n\n    pso = PSO(num_particles, bounds)\n    pso.optimize(objective_function, iterations)\n\n    print(f"Global Best Position: {pso.global_best_position}")\n    print(f"Global Best Value: {pso.global_best_value}")\n', 'truncated': False, 'file_size': 416, 'modified_ts': 1780235891.4784842, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 696, 'arguments': {'path': 'main.py', 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.004097700119018555
