s = [-10, 10]\\r\\n    num_particles = 30\\r\\n    iterations = 100\\r\\n\\r\\n    pso = PSO(num_particles, len(bounds), bounds, iterations)\\r\\n    pso.optimize(objective_function)\\r\\n\\r\\n    print(f\\"Global Best Position: {pso.global_best_position}\\")\\r\\n    print(f\\"Global Best Value: {pso.global_best_value}\\")\\r\\n",\n  "truncated": false,\n  "file_size": 446,\n  "modified_ts": 1780236247.3741615,\n  "mode": "line_range"\n}{\n  "path": "pso.py",\n  "encoding": "utf-8-sig",\n  "newline": "\\r\\n",\n  "line_count": 47,\n  "applied_edits": 1,\n  "trailing_newline": true,\n  "file_size": 2295,\n  "modified_ts": 1780236268.019201\n}{\n  "path": "pso.py",\n  "encoding": "utf-8-sig",\n  "newline": "\\r\\n",\n  "line_count": 96,\n  "applied_edits": 1,\n  "trailing_newline": true,\n  "file_size": 2493,\n  "modified_ts": 1780236268.0440238\n}{\n  "path": "pso.py",\n  "encoding": "utf-8-sig",\n  "newline": "\\r\\n",\n  "line_count": 192,\n  "applied_edits": 1,\n  "trailing_newline": true,\n  "file_size": 2879,\n  "modified_ts": 1780236268.0596037\n}{\n  "path": "main.py",\n  "encoding": "utf-8-sig",\n  "newline": "\\r\\n",\n  "line_count": 19,\n  "applied_edits": 1,\n  "trailing_newline": true,\n  "file_size": 533,\n  "modified_ts": 1780236268.063212\n}', 'output': 'The modifications have been successfully applied to the code as per the review comments. Here are the changes made:\n\n1. **Completion of the `optimize` Method in `pso.py`**:\n   - Added the logic to update `global_best_value` and `global_best_position` in the `optimize` method.\n   ```python\n   if value < self.global_best_value:\n       self.global_best_value = value\n       self.global_best_position = np.copy(particle.position)\n   ```\n\n2. **Added Comments**:\n   - Added a comment in the `optimize` method to clarify the purpose of updating the global best position.\n   - Added a docstring at the top of `pso.py` to describe the purpose of the file.\n\n3. **Documented the Main Module**:\n   - Add